4167f96b65023874bc786\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31T16:54:59-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#796)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"59053289a79ec91cc14f2b6939395afa3fa9db34\",\"date\":\"2026-07-30T20:31:29-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#795)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"4609dcbbcb3a438a135aa3af7c8b0eaf1aa85927\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31T02:13:27+03:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Shorten the billing admin card copy so it fits its tile\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"The billing card on the system administration page used a long\\ndescription, Billable services, cash points, payment modes, discounts,\\nand refunds, as its content line. The admin card tiles have a fixed\\nheight with the arrow icon absolutely positioned in the bottom right\\ncorner, so the three line description overlapped the icon and ran into\\nthe bottom edge of the tile.\\n\\nThe card now follows the pattern the other admin cards use, where the\\nheading is a Manage <domain> category and the content is the name of\\nthe destination: Manage billing over Billing administration.\\n\\nThe billable services landing page header is renamed from Billable\\nservices management to Billing administration to match the card, since\\nthe page covers more than billable services. This finishes the rename\\nstarted in #792, which settled on Billing administration as the name\\nfor this area.\\n\",\"authorName\":\"denniskigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"0e23661008df5f01a3c935fa0c3eb02ff96d49f6\",\"date\":\"2026-07-30T16:54:57-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#794)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"023f5b58f16bced4d5bd551307c298953296be7b\",\"date\":\"2026-07-30T15:35:51+05:30\",\"message\":\"(chore) Rename billing admin card to Billing administration (#792)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (chore) Rename billing admin card to Billing administration\\n\\n* (chore) Sort translation keys\\n\\n* (chore) Include payment modes in billing administration card description\\n\\nThe billing administration view also exposes payment modes configuration,\\nso add it to the card's sub-line.\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"43484c2567da510ea6834989e24b9c47d0bb876a\",\"date\":\"2026-07-27T16:36:13-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#793)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"cbef19c3dc90fd5fcf747f76f33ec9690f202390\",\"date\":\"2026-07-21T16:55:30-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#791)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"1aa676ecd75cf660a606c9dac52a8d8ccc6a87e4\",\"date\":\"2026-07-15T16:28:04-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#790)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"e8e8ddb2f025c107aa37d36c55f69cd977ee995f\",\"date\":\"2026-07-14T12:33:02-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#789)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"251adb5ca7e8047a09cc89ebe5a2067f0bc6f3fa\",\"date\":\"2026-07-10T20:28:38-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#788)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"1dce51ddc53e24f0864c2eed5fa9cbe8bf42030b\",\"date\":\"2026-07-09T20:34:37-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#787)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"autho