e, and\\nthe title in a p. Render PageHeader and PageHeaderContent instead, with\\nthe framework's PaymentsDeskPictogram, so billing picks up the same\\nheader as the rest of O3: the configured implementation name above the\\ntitle, and framework fixes such as the title rendering as a heading.\\n\\nThe billing dashboard's title changes from \\\"Home\\\" to \\\"Billing\\\", since\\n\\\"Billing\\\" no longer appears above it. The administration page keeps\\n\\\"Billing administration\\\". The header doesn't shrink in the\\nadministration page's flex layout, and the unused illustration and\\n\\\"home\\\" translation are removed.\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e90bcf41f5e898ad3ca6d32ede21a515a86be639\",\"date\":\"2026-10-07T01:24:24+03:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Highlight the active billing settings menu item (#874)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Marks the Billing settings submenu item for the current page as active.\\nThe items were never passed `isActive`, so neither Cash point\\nconfiguration nor Payment modes configuration was highlighted while it\\nwas open. The path check is the same one the Billable services,\\nDiscount requests and Refund requests links already use.\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"8a0f2427dc9173ea8f17d7249c15a694cd0f3491\",\"date\":\"2026-10-06T16:12:18-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#873)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"7db6969ab248a93930b21dbe11462003e76dac0e\",\"date\":\"2026-10-06T12:12:48-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#872)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"47641b209199fdf5f753c81e787b24dac1cbf462\",\"date\":\"2026-10-06T08:14:31-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#871)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"fd04e0fce31801eb0fa05219720757908dd04400\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05T20:19:51-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#870)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"06b8396badb16365ba307de68e05b17e91a601bf\",\"date\":\"2026-10-02T22:05:58+03:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Capture E2E server logs with the shared capture-docker-logs action (#868)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"8bc39668ad68f747857d43392fc32012f509de11\",\"date\":\"2026-10-02T12:12:16-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#867)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"7e55b1227416a133cf516e11bcf10235debf8f55\",\"date\":\"2026-10-02T08:15:14-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#866)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"aabeaa840e3bf209b35413764125ea31a1e7fbbc\",\"date\":\"2026-10-01T20:19:45-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#864)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"9d9fdd3d38088f62fcf51fff3999182c1ccee1c8\",\"date\":\"2026-10-01T16:12:20-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#863)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"66eb9d38e411f5fe5e278af951107bbbc7e4eab7\",\"date\":\"2026-10-01T08:14:57-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#862)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"6a3975515a7aaac412898b5590c664d4721b8b72\",\"date\":\"2026-09-30T20:21:36-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#861)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"c817df5388ae6f384bc8f13e4f21807c6d60b42f\",\"date\":\"2026-09-30T16:11:51-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#860)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"68986827118af65a9628798f6e84db5c06b6d78e\",\"date\":\"2026-09-30T12:12:27-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#859)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"d7709b45a79100e07ba5eb03ab0e4a071ae11bb1\",\"date\":\"2026-09-30T16:59:54+03:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Remove leftover workspace v1 container (#857)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Removes the v1 WorkspaceContainer from the billable services home page.\\nThe billing app already uses workspace v2, which the app shell renders on\\nits own, so the container renders nothing today.\\n\\nopenmrs-esm-core#1893 removes WorkspaceContainer from the framework. Once\\nthat ships, the import resolves to undefined and rendering it crashes the\\nbillable services page.\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"0c54b0e3f19ddbcbf94c972f7839361ab237a30c\",\"date\":\"2026-09-29T20:20:21-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#858)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"35dbdd352e989a2076cbf8041765bf845ae48ce3\",\"date\":\"2026-09-29T16:12:05-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#856)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"04e5f8b1d53ab05dc4a4ae933b560f0869c8bd00\",\"date\":\"2026-09-29T08:15:19-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#855)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"e021519623779cdf5f866fa0541aecfdbcc4aeaa\",\"date\":\"2026-09-29T12:05:55+03:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Load billing pages, forms and modals only when they open (#854)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Load billing pages, forms and modals only when they open\\n\\nRegister the billing dashboard, billable services page, bill history,\\nvisit check-in form and the seven modals that used getSyncLifecycle with\\ngetAsyncLifecycle instead, so their code only loads when they're shown.\\n\\nWith getSyncLifecycle, all of them were part of the code the module loads\\nas soon as it starts, and the Billing link on the home page starts the\\nmodule. So every session downloaded billing's invoice and forms, along\\nwith zod, react-hook-form and react-to-print, before anyone opened\\nanything billing-related. The module now loads 67 KiB up front instead of\\n297 KiB. The nav links, left panel links and patient banner tags stay\\nsynchronous because they render on other apps' pages.\\n\\n* Share react-router-dom with the app shell\\n\\nAdd react-router-dom to peerDependencies, so billing uses the copy the app\\nshell provides.\\n\\nWithout it, billing bundled and loaded its own copy of react-router-dom,\\nreact-router and @remix-run/router (about 14 KiB), even though the app\\nshell already shares them.\\n\\n* Remove the unused billable services app menu item\\n\\nRemove the billableServicesAppMenuItem extension, its routes.json entry\\nand the menu item component. It was registered in app-menu-item-slot,\\nwhich nothing in the reference application renders. The app menu\\nrenders app-menu-slot, and billable services is still reachable from\\nits System Administration card.\\n\\nThe item was added in #42 for UgandaEMR's app search, which does render\\napp-menu-item-slot, but UgandaEMR now ships its own billing fork\\n(@epcare/esm-billing-app) with its own copy of this extension. The\\n\\\"Billable services\\\" string is still used elsewhere, so the translations\\ndon't change.\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a92c838d8db85f7a6e228819cc0b1b5c4e05b0d5\",\"date\":\"2026-09-28T20:20:05-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#853)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"b54d84125004386539e0e396aacfd9790f7450af\",\"date\":\"2026-09-28T15:01:17-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#852)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"e0699b8afe1a1e93f2a4661a5e9e91e7e67f6c9b\",\"date\":\"2026-09-27T20:20:43-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#850)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"691304bd61fe15bd70bdd738e8e47c93332ed4ff\",\"date\":\"2026-09-26T12:35:18+03:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) O3-5862: Add @carbon/react to peerDependencies\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Declare @carbon/react as a 1.x peer so the build tooling shares it\\nwith the app shell instead of bundling a separate copy. It moves to\\ndevDependencies so builds and tests still resolve it locally.\\n\\n@carbon/icons-react stays unshared. The app shell does not provide it,\\nand sharing it would stop @carbon/react/icons imports from being\\ntree-shaken, so the app would load the entire icon package.\\n\",\"authorName\":\"denniskigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e0049ab9d261f1d19cedbbb77e2690ef285624b3\",\"date\":\"2026-09-25T16:10:55-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#849)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"553eb9436e34c84150de01225f85d0ba70f2881f\",\"date\":\"2026-09-25T08:13:07-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#848)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"9b8a877ebfbd3d6d5af3d705604729877f20605c\",\"date\":\"2026-09-24T16:12:04-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#847)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"2a137e87983b3101b6b7d969f7f9c4acb71dbec2\",\"date\":\"2026-09-24T08:13:29-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#846)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"7d23af1f289cb562093d574963981d49afc6af85\",\"date\":\"2026-09-22T16:11:32-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#845)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"0bfcdc6b34d8d569fbff4ba9ed446b064e29f93c\",\"date\":\"2026-09-21T12:11:31-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#844)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"526ba5bb6acf2b661e2e148064db7d59ad59516e\",\"date\":\"2026-09-19T12:49:37-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Upgrade to SWR 2.5.1 (#843)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"af4c9d7016b0b64ea971c7caa7b2d0d64872dec0\",\"date\":\"2026-09-18T16:40:53-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#842)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEmail\":\"infrastructure@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"9b4be19482707388879661741403304472c5d24b\",\"date\":\"2026-09-18T16:10:12-04:00\",\"message\":\"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#841)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"openmrs-bot\",\"authorEm