ts.test.tsx\",\"additions\":63,\"deletions\":0},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/printable-invoice/printable-invoice.component.tsx\",\"additions\":37,\"deletions\":14},{\"path\":\"src/routes.json\",\"additions\":9,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/types/index.ts\",\"additions\":52,\"deletions\":0},{\"path\":\"translations/en.json\",\"additions\":82,\"deletions\":15}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\n\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nAdds the bill discounts feature to the billing app: cashiers can request percentage or fixed-amount discounts on a whole bill or individual line items, and admins can approve or reject pending requests from a dedicated dashboard. Approved discounts reduce the bill's net amount due and feed through to payment settlement; rejected requests leave the bill total unchanged.\\n\\nIncludes:\\n- Request-discount modal with client-side validation (percentage cap at 100%, fixed amount can't exceed the line/bill total or push the amount due negative on partially-paid bills).\\n- Admin \\\"Discount requests\\\" page and review modal with approve/reject flows.\\n- Invoice page integration: discount/net amount trio, request-discount entry points hidden on PAID/ADJUSTED bills and per-line-item when an existing discount targets the line.\\n\\n## Screenshots\\n\\n<!-- Required if you are making UI changes. -->\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edce149e-447b-4000-8f04-676e8d99f8d2\\n\\n## Related Issue\\n\\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira ticket here if one exists. -->\\nhttps://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3-5417\\n\\n## Other\\n\\n<!-- Anything not covered above —>\\nThis also cleans up the previous bill waiver functionality that we had, because the discount feature was meant to replace it.\\n\\n### Backend dependency: BillDiscount purge\\n\\nThe e2e spec for the discount workflow (`e2e/specs/bill-discounts.spec.ts`) is **skipped** in this PR. The backend's `BillDiscountResource.purge` currently throws `UnsupportedOperationException`, and the `bill_discount` FK on `cashier_bill_line_item` has no `ON DELETE CASCADE`, so once a bill has a discount the e2e cleanup can't purge it — the test patient and bill leak between runs. The discount-purging helper in `e2e/commands/billing-operations.ts` is commented out for the same reason.\\n\\nA follow-up PR on `openmrs-module-billing` will add purge support for `BillDiscount` (or cascade the purge from `Bill`). Once that ships, un-skip the spec and uncomment `purgeBillDiscounts` in `deleteBill`.\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b26a3ad-b8ff-4001-a027-cf0b70140137","uuid":"2b23b9c3-4694-40c7-931e-d705364c784e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:24:03.901Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":732,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"NethmiRodrigo\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-15T11:36:32.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/732\",\"mergeCommit\":\"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:47.249Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5417\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"e2e/commands/billing-operati