{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016yaTE1uuveaQsBmTJm6CrM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":769,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(feat) O3-5743: Show an empty state with a Finalize bill action on pending bills\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"NethmiRodrigo\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-16T14:56:42.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-06-17T13:19:52.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-06-17T13:19:52.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/769\",\"mergeCommit\":\"bfc75902616d01ad503df362e8c1b84cef60b9dc\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:47.249Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5743\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"bfc75902616d01ad503df362e8c1b84cef60b9dc\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"e2e/pages/invoice-page.ts\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"e2e/specs/billing-patient-chart.spec.ts\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/invoice.component.tsx\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/invoice.test.tsx\",\"additions\":6,\"deletions\":2},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/payments/payments.component.tsx\",\"additions\":31,\"deletions\":9},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/payments/payments.scss\",\"additions\":30,\"deletions\":0},{\"path\":\"src/invoice/payments/payments.test.tsx\",\"additions\":64,\"deletions\":16},{\"path\":\"translations/en.json\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [x] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below