{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MvUaXz8hmmRGvNRGSZCX4F","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":779,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(fix) Keep patient chart siderail visible when launching the billing form\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"denniskigen\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:30:26.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:33:27.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:33:27.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/779\",\"mergeCommit\":\"112a73f7c8a2073efb5ff14f978c7fd11d2b5201\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:47.249Z\",\"tickets\":[],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"112a73f7c8a2073efb5ff14f978c7fd11d2b5201\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-action-menu.component.tsx\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-history.component.tsx\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2},{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-history.test.tsx\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/routes.json\",\"additions\":9,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\r\\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Summary\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the patient chart, launching the billing form via **Create bill** or **Add items to bill** made the chart's right-hand siderail (Clinical forms, Orders, Notes, Tasks, Patient lists) disappear.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe billing form was registered to its own workspace group (`billingFormWorkspaceGroup`). The workspaces2 system renders only one group's action menu at a time, so launching the form switched the active group away from `patient-chart` and dropped its siderail. Because the billing group defines no window icons of its own, nothing rendered in its place, so the rail vanished entirely.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis registers a chart-scoped workspace (`patient-chart-billing-form-workspace`) whose window belongs to the `patient-chart` group, and points the in-chart call sites (bill history and the bill action menu) at it. The form now opens as a window *within* the `patient-chart` group, so the group stays active and its siderail stays visible. The standalone billing pages (invoice, billable services) keep using the original `billing-form-workspace`.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n\\r\\n### Before \\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/901767c2-3502-4444-9017-fc07dbeab49c\\r\\n\\r\\n### After\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22b42b41-1efc-4961-926d-dcd8d6c8ae79\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b26a3ad-b8ff-4001-a027-cf0b70140137","uuid":"b0c97941-ab3b-449f-b89a-92ef4568b293","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:25:32.631Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":779,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(fix) Keep patient chart siderail visible when launching the billing form\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"denniskigen\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:30:26.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:33:27.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-06-25T09:33:27.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/779\",\"mergeCommit\":\"112a73f7c8a2073efb5ff14f978c7fd11d2b5201\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:47.249Z\",\"tickets\":[],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"112a73f7c8a2073efb5ff14f978c7fd11d2b5201\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-action-menu.component.tsx\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-history.component.tsx\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2},{\"path\":\"src/bill-history/bill-history.test.tsx\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/routes.json\",\"additions\":9,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\r\\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Summary\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the patient chart, launching the billing form via **Create bill** or **Add items to bill** made the chart's right-hand siderail (Clinical forms, Orders, Notes, Tasks, Patient lists) disappear.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe billing form was registered to its own workspace group (`billingFormWorkspaceGroup`). The workspaces2 system renders only one group's action menu at a time, so launching the form switched the active group away from `patient-chart` and dropped its siderail. Because the billing group defines no window icons of its own, nothing rendered in its place, so the rail vanished entirely.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis registers a chart-scoped workspace (`patient-chart-billing-form-workspace`) whose window belongs to the `patient-chart` group, and points the in-chart call sites (bill history and the bill action menu) at it. The form now opens as a window *within* the `patient-chart` group, so the group stays active and its siderail stays visible. The standalone billing pages (invoice, billable services) keep using the original `billing-form-workspace`.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n\\r\\n### Before \\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/901767c2-3502-4444-9017-fc07dbeab49c\\r\\n\\r\\n### After\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22b42b41-1efc-4961-926d-dcd8d6c8ae79\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MvUaXz8hmmRGvNRGSZCX4F","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
