{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W2ZcyH5H4zcWaheMYD7YWQ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":885,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(feat) O3-6112: Create bill / Add bill items workspace should show which patient is being billed in tablet mode\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"jwnasambu\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-14T13:19:52.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-15T15:15:44.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-15T15:15:44.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/885\",\"mergeCommit\":\"c770afca8921295dd87d8e7c185a8a4fef231376\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:47.249Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-6112\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"c770afca8921295dd87d8e7c185a8a4fef231376\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/billing-form/billing-form.scss\",\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":0},{\"path\":\"src/billing-form/billing-form.test.tsx\",\"additions\":58,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/billing-form/billing-form.workspace.tsx\",\"additions\":141,\"deletions\":133}],\"body\":\"\\r\\n## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/en-US/docs/frontend-modules/contributing/#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [x] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\r\\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Summary\\r\\n<!-- Please describe what problems your PR addresses. -->\\r\\nThe Billing \\\"Create bill / Add bill items\\\" workspace renders only the form with no patient context and on tablet widths it covered the invo